://imgur.com/a/ATpL7Xc\n\nリクエストにありがとうございます！\nインテリペリ\n\nHello Sunny Mogumi-san,\nNice to meet you! I love your bishounen-style works.\nMy request is Beir and Celia from BLACK/MATRIX 00.\nThe two are siblings. Beir is the older brother, Celia the younger sister. They are angels. If their wings are shown, there are four wings.\nI'll leave the details to you. Suggestions:\n- Simply standing together.\n- Having a picnic in front of a church.\n- Arguing\n\nCelia is a kind caregiver. Beir is a strongly devoted man, but secretly kind.\nPreferred Celia design: imgur.com/a/jZ17A2N\nPreferred Beir design: imgur.com/a/iYpNzqZ\nCelia's face: imgur.com/a/ATpL7Xc\n\nThanks for considering my request!\nInteripelli", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 730132, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "かずねこ", "screen_name": "kazuneko_jp", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1890713754821926912/XabDlmUH.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4302682754/1717121175/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 893953, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぷかぁく👾", "screen_name": "game_pklk", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1923158259265044481/MJcyqmgA.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/889594256322568192/1723537887/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 70, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comi